  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 974866,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 19: A Vietnam War Simulation for the Commodore 64\n\nStep into the boots of a young American draftee in 1965, as *19* throws you headfirst into the escalating Vietnam War. This visceral simulation for the Commodore 64 begins with a stark contrast: your comfortable civilian life abruptly shattered by the realities of conscription. Prepare for a brutal and immersive experience as you endure the relentless trials of basic training.\n\n*19* isn't just about shooting; it's about survival. You'll face grueling physical exercises that test your stamina and coordination, while psychological challenges chip away at your morale. The game realistically portrays the transformation from an ordinary teenager into a hardened soldier, demanding resourcefulness and resilience. \n\nBeyond basic training, *19* promises a glimpse into the larger Vietnam War conflict, hinting at the dramatic personal and historical events that await. Experience the war through the eyes of a soldier, grappling with the harsh realities of combat and the emotional toll it takes. Are you ready to answer the call?"
    },
